<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX SWINGS TO LOSS IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX SWINGS TO LOSS IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 2.63 vs   1.91 (profit)</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   2.16 vs   1.77 (profit)</p>
<p> Operating loss	 2.87 vs   0.59 (profit)</p>
<p> Sales		   50.63 vs  22.63</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.99 vs  10.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.03 vs  10.78</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.56 vs   4.52</p>
<p> Sales		  179.01 vs 121.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Budimex</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
